  "worked_solution": "Approaching from the left, we have $x<2,$ so we use the expression $f(x)={x}^{2}-x-2.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,{2}^{-}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,{2}^{-}}{x}^{2}-x-2 \\\\  & =(2)^{2}-2-2 \\\\  & =4-2-2 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
